- Reads the published Schedule tab (scheduleCsvUrl / SCHEDULE_CSV_URL),
  cached 5 min, skips unreadable rows, treats [TBD] as empty, keeps the
  last good copy and falls back to program.json if the sheet is down.
- Month grid with CSS-only hover/focus pop-ups: lectures link to Luma,
  weekday sessions show description, host and Sign up; Open/Full from
  seat counts. Past sessions hidden; month navigation via ?month=.
- Phones get a day-by-day list with details inline.
- Luma Open/Sold out is a placeholder until LUMA_API_KEY is available.
- /schedule.ics now lists upcoming sessions from the sheet.

